{"text": "On the eighth night, I was even more careful than usual. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> A clocks minute hand moves faster than my hand did. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I almost laughed at the idea that he did not know my secret thoughts. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly my thumb slipped on the metal of the lantern. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The old man sat up in bed, crying out, Who is there. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I kept quite still and said nothing for a whole hour. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was still sitting up in bed, listening, just as I had done night after night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I heard a low groan, and I knew it was the groan of deadly fear. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I knew that sound well, because it had often come from my own heart at night. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At last I opened the lantern, and the ray fell straight upon the vulture eye. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It was wide open, and I grew furious as I looked at it.", "alignment": {"characters": ["O", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "e", "i", "g", "h", "t", "h", " ", "n", "i", "g", "h", "t", ",", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "m", "o", "r", "e", " ", "c", "a", "r", "e", "f", "u", "l", " ", "t", "h", "a", "n", " ", "u", "s", "u", "a", "l", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "A", " ", "c", "l", "o", "c", "k", "s", " ", "m", "i", "n", "u", "t", "e", " ", "h", "a", "n", "d", " ", "m", "o", "v", "e", "s", " ", "f", "a", "s", "t", "e", "r", " ", "t", "h", "a", "n", " ", "m", "y", " ", "h", "a", "n", "d", " ", "d", "i", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", "a", "l", "m", "o", "s", "t", " ", "l", "a", "u", "g", "h", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "i", "d", "e", "a", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "k", "n", "o", "w", "